# Variables de Entorno — PWA

## Broker Configuration
VITE_BROKER_TYPE=ibkr  # ibkr | alpaca
VITE_BROKER_HOST=localhost
VITE_BROKER_PORT=7497

## API Backend
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3001
VITE_API_TIMEOUT=30000

## Market Data
VITE_MARKET_DATA_INTERVAL=1000  # milliseconds

## Feature Flags
VITE_ENABLE_BACKTESTING=true
VITE_ENABLE_OPTIONS=true
VITE_ENABLE_NEWS=true

## Development
VITE_LOG_LEVEL=debug  # debug | info | warn | error

---

## NOTAS

- Este es el archivo .env.EXAMPLE (sin valores secretos)
- Copiar a .env.local y completar con valores reales
- Nunca commitear .env ni con secretos

